...RESPONDENTS (BY SRI. ASHOK T. KATTIMANI, AGA FOR R1;
 SRI. V. SHIVARAJ HIREMATH, ADV. FOR R2-R5)
 THIS WRIT PETITION IS FILED UNDER ARTICLES 226 AND 227 OF THE CONSTITUTION OF INDIA PRAYING TO ISSUE A WRIT OF MANDAMUS OR ANY OTHER WRIT OR ORDER IN THE LIKE NATURE DIRECTING THE RESPONDENT AUTHORITIES TO INITIATE APPROPRIATE ACQUISITION PROCEEDINGS IN RESPECT OF SY.NO.324 MEASURING 6-ACS 92-CENTS AND SY NO.326 MEASURING 4-ACS. 00-CENTS SITUATED AT MEENKERE VILLAGE IN KUDLIGI TALUK IN VIEW OF THE FORMATION OF PUBLIC CHECK DAM/GOKATTE IN THE SAID LAND IN ACCORDANCE WITH LAW AND ACCORDINGLY PAY APPROPRIATE COMPENSATION TO THE PETITIONERS IF NO ACQUISITION PROCEEDINGS ARE ALREADY INITIATED AND/OR DIRECT THE RESPONDENT AUTHORITIES TO PAY APPROPRIATE COMPENSATION TO THE PETITIONERS IN VIEW OF FORMATION OF PUBLIC CHECK DAM /GOKATTE IN SY.NO.324 MEASURING 6-ACS 92-CENTS AND SY.NO.326
